---
import TickIcon from "./icons/TickIcon.astro";
---

<section class="mb-16">
  <section class="px-4 lg:px-0 mb-10">
    <div class="mb-2 w-full lg:w-265 mx-auto">
      <h2 class="text-3xl font-semibold">
        What Our <span>Customers</span> Say
      </h2>
      <h3
        class="mt-4 border-l-4 border-[#014349] pl-4 text-muted-foreground text-2xl font-light"
      >
        Our mission is to deliver compelling narratives, remarkable experiences,
        and outstanding results for our clients. Here's a few kind words from
        our fantastic customers:
      </h3>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="px-4 lg:px-0">
    <div class="w-full lg:w-265 mx-auto">
      <div
        class="p-6 w-full md:w-170 mx-auto rounded-2xl bg-[#F5EBDF] rounded-tl-[100px] rounded-br-[100px] md:rounded-4xl"
      >
        <span class="block mb-3">
          <svg
            xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg"
            width="80"
            height="80"
            viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            fill="none"
            stroke="currentColor"
            stroke-width="2"
            stroke-linecap="round"
            stroke-linejoin="round"
            class="icon icon-tabler icons-tabler-outline icon-tabler-quote-open text-[#014349]"
            ><path stroke="none" d="M0 0h24v24H0z" fill="none"></path><path
              d="M14 13h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3a1 1 0 0 1 -1 1h-3a1 1 0 0 1 -1 -1v-6q 0 -4 4 -5"
            ></path><path
              d="M5 13h4a1 1 0 0 1 1 1v3a1 1 0 0 1 -1 1h-3a1 1 0 0 1 -1 -1v-6q 0 -4 4 -5"
            ></path></svg
          >
        </span>
        <div>
          <span>
            The WuvaTM team is highly collaborative, extremely responsive and
            generates polished, sophisticated finished product. They understand
            our long-term and short-term business goals and it shows in their
            discussions and in the marketing product they provide. We gain from
            their across-the-board support from web marketing, sales enablement,
            booking dynamics.
          </span>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-5 flex gap-4">
          <!-- <div class="flex-shrink-0">s</div> -->
          <div class="flex flex-col text-sm font-semibold">
            <span>Michael Brennan</span>
            <span>Chief Marketing Officer, Viafrom Eco Resort</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</section>
